<div class="ht-editor">
  {{#if isShop}}<div class="ht-drop">Drag items here from the sidebar or a compendium to add them to stock. Set <code>stock</code> to -1 for unlimited.</div>{{/if}}
  <p class="hint">Edit as JSON. <code>scenes</code> limits where it shows up (empty = every scene). <code>hidden</code> hides it from players.
  {{#if (eq kind "terminals")}} Linked doors and lights appear under <code>controls</code>; change each <code>label</code> to name it. They keep working from any scene. Slice <code>game</code>: cipher, circuit, signal, firewall or random. Difficulty: easy, normal, hard, elite. Remove <code>slice</code> or set <code>password</code> to "" to change locking. Any message or file can add <code>"encrypted": {"dc": 15, "key": "Code Cylinder", "game": "signal"}</code> (every field optional; <code>"game": "none"</code> means it can't be sliced).{{/if}}</p>
  {{#if (eq kind "terminals")}}
  <div class="ht-link-box">
    <b><i class="fas fa-link"></i> Link doors, lights and cameras</b>
    <span>On the map, select doors (Walls layer), lights (Lighting layer) or cameras: a rectangle you draw over the area to watch (Drawings layer, set it hidden). Hold Shift to pick several. Then press:</span>
    <button type="button" class="ht-primary" data-action="linkSelected"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Add selected</button>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  <textarea name="json" spellcheck="false">{{json}}</textarea>
  <div class="ht-row">
    <button type="button" data-action="addScene">Limit to current scene{{#if sceneName}} ({{sceneName}}){{/if}}</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="save"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save</button>
  </div>
</div>
